    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1ca6c31c703a68270f5428",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉她好像有重要的事情还没跟我说。\n而且我有种预感，\n那似乎是身为训练员应该知道的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1cdbfb6caeb674f9a72416833be0feac3c231183f459d7c35b39f6b158c455",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
